    {
      "id": "eco-title",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": -1700,
      "width": 10500,
      "height": 260,
      "text": "# PPJ GROUP - Digital Application, AI & Automation Ecosystem\n## ERP -> Enterprise Applications -> Internal Systems -> AI & Automation"
    },
    {
      "id": "eco-subtitle",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": -1420,
      "width": 10500,
      "height": 200,
      "text": "### Portfolio Baseline: 19/09/2026  |  Vault Reconciliation: 24/09/2026 (portfolio snapshot)\nGenerated From: PPJ AI & Automation Portfolio (vault registry) + PPJ operating-systems landscape ([[02_BA_Knowledge/Enterprise_Architecture/PPJ_Operational_Systems_Landscape|Operational Systems Landscape]]). Regenerated automatically when the portfolio snapshot changes."
    },
    {
      "id": "eco-exec-summary",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": -1180,
      "width": 3300,
      "height": 900,
      "text": "# PPJ DIGITAL EVOLUTION\n\n### 1. WFX provides the ERP transaction backbone.\n### 2. Third-party enterprise applications provide specialized capabilities.\n### 3. GTAS applications were built internally to fill operational capability gaps.\n### 4. AI & Automation projects add an intelligence and automation layer across existing processes.\n### 5. Shared data, knowledge and AI platforms serve reusable cross-functional capabilities.\n### 6. AI does not replace the ERP; it augments ERP, enterprise systems and decisions."
    },
    {
      "id": "eco-principles",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3600,
      "y": -1180,
      "width": 3300,
      "height": 900,
      "text": "# ARCHITECTURE PRINCIPLES\n\n### - WFX remains core ERP / transaction backbone.\n### - AI projects augment rather than duplicate source systems.\n### - System of record must remain explicit.\n### - Prefer API-based integration where available.\n### - Business affinity does not imply technical integration.\n### - Human review remains required for uncertain AI decisions.\n### - Reusable data / knowledge layers serve multiple projects.\n### - Shared AI services reduce duplicate implementations.\n### - Status and lifecycle are independent from business domain."
    },
    {
      "id": "eco-inventory",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 7200,
      "y": -1180,
      "width": 3300,
      "height": 900,
      "text": "# PORTFOLIO INVENTORY\n\n## Baseline 19/09/2026 - 35 initiatives\n### Active / Dev 16 | Production 6 | Maintenance 4 | Closed 4 | On Hold 3 | Evaluation 2\n\n## Current Vault 24/09/2026 - 36 registered records\n### Production 8 | Active / Dev 9 | UAT / Eval / Analysis 5 | Maintenance 4 | On Hold 3 | Closed 7\n\nBaseline is kept unchanged. Bucket definitions differ - see the gap notes."
    },
    {
      "id": "hdr-grp-mer",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 30,
      "y": 20,
      "width": 429,
      "height": 130,
      "text": "# 04.2 MERCHANDISING"
    },
    {
      "id": "proj-mer-costingagenticplatform-v1-1-0",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 100,
      "y": 170,
      "width": 1450,
      "height": 520,
      "text": "# Agentic Costing Platform\n## [[03_Projects/PPJ.COSTING.AGENT.PLATFORM.v1.1|MER_CostingAgenticPlatform_v1.1.0]]\n## Active Development\n### AI APPLICATION (agents / decision support)\n\nDomain: Merchandising\nBaseline code: COSTING.AGENTIC.PLATFORM.v1.1\nCapability: Costing and quotation package: Sew Agent, Wash Agent, BOM, consumption, similar style. AI proposes, domain expert approves.\nAlso relates to: Bill of Material, GTAS Costing.",
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "proj-mer-marketintelligence-v1-1-0",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 100,
      "y": 740,
      "width": 1450,
      "height": 520,
      "text": "# Market Intelligence\n## [[03_Projects/E-commerce Market Intelligence v.2.3|MER_MarketIntelligence_v1.1.0]]\n## Active Intelligence\n### AI APPLICATION (data intelligence)\n\nDomain: Merchandising\nBaseline code: MER.MARKET.INTELLIGENCE.v1.1\nCapability: Market, customer, product and material opportunity signals from external data and internal history.\nIntelligence layer - not a system of record.\nData input: Enterprise Data / DWH and sales / PO / fabric history (no line drawn).",
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "proj-mer-invoicedatarecheck-v1-1-0",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 100,
      "y": 1310,
      "width": 1450,
      "height": 520,
      "text": "# Invoice Data Recheck\n## [[03_Projects/MER.CHICOS.INVOICE.RECHECK-AUDIT.v1.1|MER_InvoiceDataRecheck_v1.1.0]]\n## Production / Support\n### AUTOMATION (audit / rule engine)\n\nDomain: Merchandising\nBaseline code: MER.INVOICE.DATA.RECHECK.v1.1\nCapability: Cross-check costing, commercial and invoice data with configurable customer rule packs; exceptions go to human review.",
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "proj-mer-pocommit-v1-1-0",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 100,
      "y": 1880,
      "width": 1450,
      "height": 520,
      "text": "# PO Commit Automation\n## [[03_Projects/MER.PO-Commit|MER_POCommit_v1.1.0]]\n## Closed\n### AUTOMATION\n\nDomain: Merchandising\nBaseline code: MER.PO.Commit.v1.1\nCapability: Customer order to MER PO creation; about 70-80% of customer scenarios covered. Historical record.\nHistorical affinity: Buyer Order Management (no line drawn for closed projects).",
      "color": "#8c8c8c"
    },
    {
      "id": "hdr-grp-src",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 30,
      "y": 2670,
      "width": 567,
      "height": 130,
      "text": "# 04.1 SOURCING / PURCHASING"
    },
    {
      "id": "proj-scp-sourcingchatbot-v2-3-0",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 100,
      "y": 2820,
      "width": 1450,
      "height": 520,
      "text": "# Sourcing AI Chatbot\n## [[03_Projects/SCP.SOURCING.CHATBOT.v2.3|SCP_SourcingChatbot_v2.3.0]]\n## Production\n### AI APPLICATION (RAG / chatbot)\n\nDomain: Sourcing / Purchasing\nBaseline code: SCP.SOURCING.CHATBOT.v2.3\nCapability: Supplier, material and sample search, comparison and sourcing knowledge retrieval.\nAlso relates to: WFX Raw Material Planning.",
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "proj-pur-adhocindentsouth-v1-0-0",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 100,
      "y": 3390,
      "width": 1450,
      "height": 520,
      "text": "# Adhoc Indent Automation (South)\n## [[03_Projects/PUR.Adhoc Indent mien Nam|PUR_AdhocIndentSouth_v1.0.0]]\n## Maintenance\n### AUTOMATION (rule-based)\n\nDomain: Sourcing / Purchasing\nBaseline code: PUR.Adhoc.Indent.South.v1.0\nCapability: Repeated Adhoc Indent processing for the South region; WFX compatibility.",
      "color": "#6f8fa8"
    },
    {
      "id": "proj-pur-hmlabelprocessing-v1-0-0",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 100,
      "y": 3960,
      "width": 1450,
      "height": 520,
      "text": "# H&M Label-O Processing\n## [[03_Projects/PUR.H&M Label-O Processing|PUR_HMLabelProcessing_v1.0.0]]\n## On Hold\n### AUTOMATION (rule-based)\n\nDomain: Sourcing / Purchasing\nBaseline code: PUR.HM.LabelO.Processing.Automation.v1.0\nCapability: H&M Label-O processing; paused pending a scalable business case.",
      "color": "2"
    },
    {
      "id": "proj-pur-materialallocation-v1-1-0",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 100,
      "y": 4530,
      "width": 1450,
      "height": 520,
      "text": "# Material Allocation Automation\n## [[03_Projects/PUR.Material.Allocation.v1.2|PUR_MaterialAllocation_v1.1.0]]\n## Validation / Stabilization\n### AUTOMATION (workflow / transaction)\n\nDomain: Sourcing / Purchasing\nBaseline code: PUR.Material.Allocation.v1.1\nCapability: Surplus-material unreserve and reallocation across OCs. First Sewing / Embroidery flow validated.\nAlso relates to: WFX Raw Material Planning, Purchase Order Management.",
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "proj-pur-inventoryreport-v2-1-0",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 100,
      "y": 5100,
      "width": 1450,
      "height": 520,
      "text": "# Purchasing Inventory Report\n## [[03_Projects/PUR.Inventory Report|PUR_InventoryReport_v2.1.0]]\n## Production\n### DATA PLATFORM (reporting / visibility)\n\nDomain: Sourcing / Purchasing\nBaseline code: PUR.Inventory.Report.v2.1\nCapability: Purchasing inventory and material visibility. A data-visibility layer, not an automation bot.\nAlso relates to: WFX Inventory Control, MMSx.",
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "proj-pur-gdiautomation-v1-0-0",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 100,
      "y": 5670,
      "width": 1450,
      "height": 520,
      "text": "# GDI Automation\n## [[03_Projects/PUR.GDI Automation|PUR_GDIAutomation_v1.0.0]]\n## Active Development / WFX API Integration\n### AUTOMATION (API-first transaction)\n\nDomain: Sourcing / Purchasing\nBaseline code: PUR.GDI.Automation.v1.0\nCapability: Goods dispatch / GDI data entry through WFX GET / POST APIs; API specification and UAT still ahead.\nSystem of Record: WFX.\nAlso relates to: WFX Logistics In-bound, Inventory Control.",
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "hdr-grp-fab",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 30,
      "y": 6460,
      "width": 670,
      "height": 130,
      "text": "# 04.7 FABRIC / TEXTILES TECHNIQUE"
    },
    {
      "id": "proj-td-technicalknowledgeplatform-v2-1-0",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 100,
      "y": 6610,
      "width": 1450,
      "height": 520,
      "text": "# Technical Knowledge Platform\n## [[03_Projects/TD.TechnicalPlatform_v2.1|TD_TechnicalKnowledgePlatform_v2.1.0]]\n## Sync Validation & Stabilization\n### DATA PLATFORM (knowledge foundation)\n\nDomain: Fabric / Textiles Technique\nBaseline code: TD.TechnicalKnowledge.Platform.v2.1\nCapability: Reusable technical knowledge for pattern, BOM, consumption, costing, sew, wash and technical search.\nKnowledge / data foundation - not an ERP system of record.",
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "proj-fab-fabricdatamart-v2-2-0",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 100,
      "y": 7180,
      "width": 1450,
      "height": 520,
      "text": "# Fabric Datamart\n## [[03_Projects/FD.Datamart.v2.2|FAB_FabricDatamart_v2.2.0]]\n## Support\n### DATA PLATFORM (datamart)\n\nDomain: Fabric / Textiles Technique\nBaseline code: FD.Datamart.v2.2\nCapability: Fabric, Hanger, QR and material reference data (Directus). Separate from CPD.",
      "color": "#6f8fa8"
    },
    {
      "id": "proj-cpd-visualsampledatamart-v1-1-0",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 100,
      "y": 7750,
      "width": 1450,
      "height": 520,
      "text": "# Visual Sample Datamart\n## [[03_Projects/CPD.Datamart.v1.1|CPD_VisualSampleDatamart_v1.1.0]]\n## Maintenance\n### DATA PLATFORM (datamart)\n\nDomain: Fabric / Textiles Technique\nBaseline code: CPD.Datamart.v1.1\nCapability: 3D / visual sample library and image search. Separate from FD.",
      "color": "#6f8fa8"
    },
    {
      "id": "proj-ppjxstratova-ai",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 100,
      "y": 8320,
      "width": 1450,
      "height": 520,
      "text": "# Stratova AI (historical)\n## [[03_Projects/PPJxStratova AI|PPJxStratova.AI]]\n## Closed\n### ARCHIVED (former AI PoC)\n\nDomain: Fabric / Textiles Technique\nCapability: Closed in the vault registry. The current pattern-generation PoC is tracked as DISCOVERY_PatternGenerationPoC (zone 06).\nBusiness affinity: Gerber, ShapeShifter - no integration confirmed.",
      "color": "#8c8c8c"
    },
    {
      "id": "hdr-grp-hr",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 8880,
      "y": 20,
      "width": 240,
      "height": 130,
      "text": "# 04.8 HR"
    },
    {
      "id": "proj-hr-employeedataplatform-v1-1-0",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 8950,
      "y": 170,
      "width": 1450,
      "height": 520,
      "text": "# HR Employee Data Platform\n## [[03_Projects/HR.SS&PFD.v1.1|HR_EmployeeDataPlatform_v1.1.0]]\n## Production / Expansion\n### WORKFLOW (data standardization)\n\nDomain: HR\nBaseline code: HR.SSPFD.Workflow.v1.1\nCapability: Employee data collection, validation and standardization into an Employee Master; applicant extraction / prefill.",
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
