      "text": "# 04.9 ADMINISTRATION"
    },
    {
      "id": "proj-admin-expensemanagement-v1-1-0",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 8950,
      "y": 1110,
      "width": 1450,
      "height": 520,
      "text": "# Business Travel & Expense Management\n## [[03_Projects/ADMIN_ExpenseManagement_v1.1.0|ADMIN_ExpenseManagement_v1.1.0]]\n## Active / Requirement Refinement / UAT Preparation\n### WORKFLOW\n\nDomain: Administration\nBaseline code: Admin Expense Management.v1.1\nCapability: Request, approval, trip, advance, expense, settlement; multi-traveler requests. E-office integration is in scope.\nAlso relates to: HRIS / master data, Finance.",
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "hdr-grp-fin",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 8880,
      "y": 1900,
      "width": 550,
      "height": 130,
      "text": "# 04.3 FINANCE / ACCOUNTING"
    },
    {
      "id": "proj-fin-financemanagement-v1-2-0",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 8950,
      "y": 2050,
      "width": 1450,
      "height": 520,
      "text": "# Finance AI Management\n## [[03_Projects/FIN.AI.FINANCE.MANAGEMENT.v1.1|FIN_FinanceManagement_v1.2.0]]\n## Strategic Active\n### AI APPLICATION (finance analytics platform)\n\nDomain: Finance / Accounting\nBaseline code: FIN.AI.FINANCE.MANAGEMENT.v1.2\nCapability: WS1 financial Q&A; WS2 OC cost and profitability control; WS3 factory cost integrity. Cross-system finance intelligence.\nData sources: WFX Finance + DWH + Power BI + GTAS BI Report / Financial Statements. Not a financial system of record.",
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "proj-fin-invoicedownloader-v1-2-0",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 8950,
      "y": 2620,
      "width": 1450,
      "height": 520,
      "text": "# Invoice Downloader\n## [[03_Projects/PPJ.Invoice Downloader.v1.2|FIN_InvoiceDownloader_v1.2.0]]\n## Production\n### AUTOMATION\n\nDomain: Finance / Accounting\nBaseline code: PPJ.InvoiceDownloader.v1.2\nCapability: Downloads VNPT e-invoice files: session / cookie management and file retrieval. No accounting entry.",
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "proj-acc-grnsupplierinvoicebot-v2-3-0",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 8950,
      "y": 3190,
      "width": 1450,
      "height": 520,
      "text": "# GRN Supplier Invoice Bot\n## [[03_Projects/ACC.GRN-SupplierInvoiceBot.v2.3|ACC_GRNSupplierInvoiceBot_v2.3.0]]\n## Production Support\n### AUTOMATION (transaction bot)\n\nDomain: Finance / Accounting\nBaseline code: ACC.GRNInvoiceMatching.v2.3 (vault calls this name misleading)\nCapability: Validation, business rules and automated data entry for GRN and supplier invoices.\nAlso relates to: WFX Logistics In-bound (GRN), Purchase Order Management.",
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "proj-acc-inventoryreport-v1-0-0",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 8950,
      "y": 3760,
      "width": 1450,
      "height": 520,
      "text": "# Accounting Inventory Report\n## [[03_Projects/ACC.Inventory.Report.v1.0|ACC_InventoryReport_v1.0.0]]\n## Closed\n### DATA PLATFORM (reporting)\n\nDomain: Finance / Accounting\nBaseline code: ACC.Inventory.Report.v1.0\nCapability: Accounting inventory reporting. Distinct from the Purchasing Inventory Report.",
      "color": "#8c8c8c"
    },
    {
      "id": "proj-exim-expenseinvoices-automation-v1-1",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 8950,
      "y": 4330,
      "width": 1450,
      "height": 520,
      "text": "# EXIM Expense Invoice Bot (legacy)\n## [[03_Projects/EXIM.ExpenseInvoices.Automation.v1.1|EXIM.ExpenseInvoices.Automation.v1.1]]\n## Closed\n### AUTOMATION\n\nDomain: Finance / Accounting\nCapability: Legacy EXIM expense-invoice automation, replaced by LOG_ExpenseInvoiceProcessing_v1.2.2.\nNot in the 35-item baseline; present in the vault registry.",
      "color": "#8c8c8c"
    },
    {
