      "type": "text",
      "x": 8950,
      "y": 5270,
      "width": 1450,
      "height": 520,
      "text": "# AI Defect Detection\n## [[03_Projects/PPJxQSee.ai|QC_DefectDetection_v1.0.0]]\n## On Hold\n### AI APPLICATION (computer vision)\n\nDomain: QC / TQM\nBaseline code: PPJxQSee.AI\nCapability: Image, defect detection, classification, QC review. Vendor proposal and NDA only - not an approved PoC.\nStream: EXTERNAL DEVELOPMENT. Also relates to: WFX QA, Production Management.",
      "color": "2"
