      "y": 5840,
      "width": 1450,
      "height": 520,
      "text": "# RFID Thread Traceability\n## [[03_Projects/PPJ XPrimo1D RFID Thread|QC_ThreadTraceability_v1.0.0]]\n## Pre-PoC / Business Case\n### POC / EVALUATION\n\nDomain: QC / TQM\nBaseline code: QC.Primo1D.RFID.Thread.v1.0\nCapability: RFID thread identification and traceability. Business case only; no PoC approved.\nStream: EXTERNAL DEVELOPMENT. No operational integration assumed.",
