      "width": 1450,
      "height": 520,
      "text": "# Hanging Line IoT\n## [[03_Projects/PROD.IOT.CHuyenTreo_1|PROD_HangingLineIoT_v1.0.0]]\n## Development\n### IOT\n\nDomain: Production + Wash\nBaseline code: PROD.IOT.CHuyenTreo.v1.0\nCapability: Production hanging-line digitalization and monitoring. IoT / operational, not an LLM application.\nAlso relates to: WFX Production Planning.",
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "proj-wash-samplingmanagement-v1-1-0",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 8950,
      "y": 7350,
      "width": 1450,
      "height": 520,
      "text": "# Wash Sampling Management Portal\n## [[03_Projects/WASH.SAMPLING.MANAGEMENT.PORTAL.v1.1|WASH_SamplingManagement_v1.1.0]]\n## Analysis / Product Design\n### WORKFLOW\n\nDomain: Production + Wash\nBaseline code: WASH.SAMPLING.MANAGEMENT.PORTAL.v1.1\nCapability: Wash sample request, planning, result and approval in the PPJ Group Portal.\nAlso relates to: WFX Production Management.",
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "proj-wash-cowash-v2-0-0",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 8950,
      "y": 7920,
      "width": 1450,
      "height": 520,
      "text": "# COWASH Wash Operations\n## [[03_Projects/PROD.COWASH|WASH_COWASH_v2.0.0]]\n## On Hold\n### SYSTEM / APPLICATION (production wash platform)\n\nDomain: Production + Wash\nBaseline code: PROD.COWASH.v2.0\nCapability: Wash production workflow and operational data. Distinct from the sampling portal.\nAlso relates to: WFX QC.",
      "color": "2"
    },
    {
      "id": "hdr-grp-whl",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 8880,
      "y": 8710,
      "width": 567,
      "height": 130,
      "text": "# 04.6 WAREHOUSE / LOGISTICS"
    },
    {
      "id": "proj-wh-awbextraction-v1-1-0",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 8950,
      "y": 8860,
      "width": 1450,
      "height": 520,
      "text": "# AWB Document Intelligence\n## [[03_Projects/WH_AWBExtraction_v1.1.0|WH_AWBExtraction_v1.1.0]]\n## Active Development\n### AI APPLICATION (document intelligence)\n\nDomain: Warehouse\nBaseline code: WH.AWB.EXTRACTION.v1.1\nCapability: AWB image OCR and DHL email parsing into one validated canonical AWB record; human validation.\nAlso relates to: GTAS Transportation.",
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "proj-log-expenseinvoiceprocessing-v1-2-2",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 8950,
      "y": 9430,
      "width": 1450,
      "height": 520,
      "text": "# Expense Invoice Processing\n## [[03_Projects/PPJ. Expense-Invoices.v1.1|LOG_ExpenseInvoiceProcessing_v1.2.2]]\n## Regional Rollout / UAT\n### AUTOMATION (regional invoice)\n\nDomain: Logistics / EXIM\nBaseline code: PPJ.ExpenseInvoices.v1.1 + LOG.EXPENSE.INVOICES.V1.2 (one project in the vault)\nCapability: Logistics / EXIM expense invoices: regional and tax rules, validation, exceptions. Regions: HCM, Da Nang, Nha Trang, Ha Noi.\nMerged in the vault registry - see gap note 1.",
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "hdr-grp-shared",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2580,
      "y": 20,
      "width": 550,
      "height": 130,
      "text": "# 04.10 SHARED AI PLATFORMS"
    },
    {
      "id": "proj-ai-perriplatform-v3-2-0",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2925,
      "y": 170,
      "width": 1450,
      "height": 520,
      "text": "# PERRI Enterprise Chatbot\n## [[03_Projects/PPJ.PERRI.Chatbot|AI_PERRIPlatform_v3.2.0]]\n## Production\n### INTERNAL PLATFORM (shared AI channel)\n\nDomain: Internal Chatbot & AI Platforms\nBaseline code: PPJ.PERRI.Chatbot.v3.2\nCapability: Enterprise Q&A and orchestration: intent, agent / tool, controlled response. Not a business-domain application.\nEnterprise knowledge access: no per-project dependency drawn.",
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "proj-ai-applicationhub-v2-1-0",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 4525,
      "y": 170,
      "width": 1450,
      "height": 520,
      "text": "# PPJ AI Hub\n## [[03_Projects/PPJ.AI.Hub.v2.1|AI_ApplicationHub_v2.1.0]]\n## Internal Production Platform\n### INTERNAL PLATFORM (shared AI access layer)\n\nDomain: Internal Chatbot & AI Platforms\nBaseline code: PPJ.AI.Hub.v2.1\nCapability: AI application discovery, access and launch layer. Not the project registry.\nNo project is drawn as using AI Hub - none is confirmed.",
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "proj-ppj-glpi-helpdesk-ai-chatbot-v1-0",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 6125,
      "y": 170,
      "width": 1450,
      "height": 520,
      "text": "# GLPI Helpdesk AI Chatbot\n## [[03_Projects/PPJ.GLPI-Helpdesk-AI Chatbot|PPJ.GLPI.Helpdesk.AI.Chatbot.v1.0]]\n## Maintenance\n### AI APPLICATION (IT helpdesk)\n\nDomain: Internal Chatbot & AI Platforms\nCapability: IT helpdesk Q&A, troubleshooting, ERP support and resolved-issue knowledge. Separate from PERRI.",
      "color": "#6f8fa8"
    },
    {
      "id": "shared-note",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2925,
      "y": 740,
      "width": 4650,
