      "text": "### Enterprise capabilities, not business-domain applications.\nConceptual direction: business AI applications -> PPJ AI Hub -> shared AI services / governance / knowledge / models. Lines to AI Hub or PERRI are drawn only where documentation confirms use. None is confirmed today."
