    {
      "id": "flow-labels",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2550,
      "y": 6680,
      "width": 5400,
      "height": 1000,
      "text": "# CAPABILITY FLOWS (explanatory - not integrations)\n\n### SOURCING: Supplier > Material > Search > Decision\n### PURCHASING: PO > Material > Allocation > Dispatch\n### MERCHANDISING: Market > Costing > Quotation > PO\n### PRODUCTION: Planning > Production > Wash > QC\n### FINANCE: Transaction > Reporting > Cost Control > RCA\n### LOGISTICS: Shipment > AWB > Tracking > Invoice\n### ADMIN: Request > Approval > Booking > Advance > Expense > Settlement\n### TECHNICAL: Fabric > Pattern > BOM > Knowledge > Costing"
    },
    {
      "id": "source-systems-diagram",
      "type": "file",
      "x": -4600,
      "y": -1700,
      "width": 3200,
      "height": 1785,
      "file": "99_Attachments/PPJ_Operational_Systems_Landscape_Diagram.png"
    },
    {
      "id": "hdr-grp-poc",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -4570,
      "y": 2350,
      "width": 876,
      "height": 130,
      "text": "# 06 POC / VENDOR EVALUATION (evaluation only)"
    },
    {
      "id": "poc-discovery-patterngenerationpoc",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -4500,
      "y": 2500,
      "width": 1450,
      "height": 520,
      "text": "# PatternGenerationPoC\n## [[03_Projects/_Registry/PPJ_DISCOVERY_REGISTER|DISCOVERY_PatternGenerationPoC]]\n## DAF / Commercial / Technical Scope Negotiation\n### VENDOR EVALUATION (discovery item, not a project)\n\nScope: Pattern generation PoC. Do not reuse the historical PPJxStratova.AI code.\nOpen: Google DAF approval; Funding liability; Rejection responsibility; Termination clause ...\nNo operational integration assumed.",
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "poc-cand-cpd-in-house-pattern-generation",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -2950,
      "y": 2500,
      "width": 1450,
      "height": 520,
      "text": "# CPD In-house Pattern Generation\n## [[03_Projects/_Registry/Project_Update_Proposals/CPD_IN_HOUSE_PATTERN_GENERATION_CURRENT_INITIATIVE|CPD In-house Pattern Generation]]\n## Internal Prototype / Evaluation\n### CANDIDATE (not a registered project)\n\nCapability: Build an internal pattern-generation benchmark from techpack/image/measurement inputs with Pattern Engineer and CAD validation.\nCanonical code not confirmed.",
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "proj-ppjxnunox-scantrial",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -4500,
      "y": 3070,
      "width": 1450,
      "height": 520,
      "text": "# NUNOX Scan Trial\n## [[03_Projects/PPJxNUNOX|PPJxNUNOX.ScanTrial]]\n## Partnership / Digital Library Evaluation\n### POC / EVALUATION\n\nDomain: Fabric / Textiles Technique\nCapability: Fabric scanning and Fabric / Garment Digital Library evaluation. Session outcome unconfirmed.\nStream: EXTERNAL DEVELOPMENT. No operational integration assumed.",
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "poc-wizcore",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -2950,
      "y": 3070,
      "width": 1450,
      "height": 520,
      "text": "# Wizcore\n## [[03_Projects/_Registry/PPJ_DISCOVERY_REGISTER|Wizcore]]\n## Smart Factory Discovery\n### VENDOR EVALUATION (discovery item, not a project)\n\nScope: Factory -> IoT -> Connectivity -> Integration -> Data -> Dashboard -> Traceability -> Analytics / AI.\nNo operational integration assumed.",
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "poc-faceworks-ai",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -4500,
      "y": 3640,
      "width": 1450,
