      "text": "# Faceworks AI\n## [[03_Projects/_Registry/PPJ_DISCOVERY_REGISTER|Faceworks AI]]\n## Technology Assessment\n### VENDOR EVALUATION (discovery item, not a project)\n\nScope: Potential garment/textile AI capabilities under evaluation.\nNo operational integration assumed.",
